{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19057","headline":"和李相公以平泉新墅获方外之名因爲诗以报洛中士君子兼见寄之什 · 刘禹锡","name":"和李相公以平泉新墅获方外之名因爲诗以报洛中士君子兼见寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"业继韦平後，家依崑阆间。\n恩华辞北第，潇洒爱东山。\n满室图书在，入门松菊闲。\n垂天虽暂息，一举出人寰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}